1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,268
Show day, without surprises: four checks that keep the screens up.

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:09,063
Run the show once. A red card means a file is missing; relink it.

3
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:13,486
Lock editing while live, so a stray drag can't change the show.

4
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:18,347
A cable comes out? Plug it back in, and the screen comes right back.

5
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:22,288
After the last slide: clear, power off, then quit.

6
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,597
Relink. Lock. Unplug. Pack down.

7
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,799
Episode eighteen walks you through it.
